"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The staff-size element indicates how large a staff space is on this staff, expressed as a percentage of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"work’s default scaling. Values less than 100 make the staff space smaller while values over 100 make the staff"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"space larger. A staff-type of cue, ossia, or editorial implies a staff-size of less than 100, but the exact"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value is implementation-dependent unless specified here. Staff size affects staff height only, not the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"relationship of the staff to the left and right margins."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLStaffSize"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStaffSize"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]}}}